; Factions of the Zone: the faction you lead, fotz_own, and its player twin, actor_fotz_own.
;
; Team numbers must stay under 64 (the engine's max_team_count); stalker factions use 0-31 and
; another faction mod uses 32 and 33. Each row holds one value: the engine reads every missing
; column as 0, and fotz_faction.script sets the real relations when you found your faction.
;
; No save ever holds these: before each save the mod returns every member, and you, to the faction
; they came from. Removing the mod is safe.

![game_relations]
>communities = fotz_own, 36, actor_fotz_own, 37

![communities_relations]
fotz_own = 0
actor_fotz_own = 0

![communities_sympathy]
fotz_own = 0.0
actor_fotz_own = 0.0
